  "implementation": [
    "Navigation arms first real input to resume focus, including asynchronous IME; nested keyDown counts once. Empty marked cancellation/unmark/panel cleanup refresh geometry only. Disabled/read-only/hidden/draft-error protections remain.",
    "Return layout ensures bounded candidate range then commits viewport; fresh available line snapshots replace stale objects. Scoped viewport callback guard prevents presentation-only events. No fabricated row positions or changed fade constants.",
    "Native layout schedules existing coalesced weak main-queue focus/caret refresh instead of synchronously reentering TextKit; idle queue quiesces. This alone was insufficient in real screens.",
    "Bounded immutable native glyph tiles isolate live window paint from native text drawing state. Only current viewport cache; original native scroll opacity restored on exit/failure. Any failed capture returns entire frame to native editor.",
    "Cache key includes strong-lived native source attributed-string identity and local character range, immutable visible attributes, metrics and scale; this preserves contextual shaping without whole-document copies. CGImage ownership releases on tile deallocation; paint does not write body/selection/revision/IME state."
  ],
